                                "sense_id": "d7f46f0b-a9c1-3975-aaa9-1b86ce71252a",
                                "text": "[…]; the inhabitants' benign indifference to idiosyncratic behavior (the way, for example, that you could walk down the street in nothing but a pair of baffies with a budgerigar on your head and no-one would think twice of it)."
                            },
                            {
