                                "sense_id": "d7f46f0b-a9c1-3975-aaa9-1b86ce71252a",
                                "text": "[…] put him oot the door in his semmit an his baffies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04d14a29-abbe-4729-9ade-141af85558d8",
                                "sense_id": "d7f46f0b-a9c1-3975-aaa9-1b86ce71252a",
                                "text": "“You can’t be walking about in the muck with naught but your skirts and baffies. […]” ¶ By process of elimination I narrowed the word baffies to mean some sort of footwear."
